Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Prepare a curated record with confidence categories grounded in evidence, preserved alternatives, and project-specific disclosure controls. Publish provisional and verified statuses distinctly and update derivatives when experts or observers provide corrections.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
